Sub Invaders sprite sheet

Author: orchestrator agent yoga-si (sub-agent cs02-sprite-asset-author)
Date: 2026-05-13

Authoring method: Programmatically generated via Node stdlib zlib and a hand-rolled PNG encoder. No external assets, no third-party libraries, no AI image generation; the RGBA pixel buffer was hand-coded by the sub-agent.

Dedication: CC0 1.0 Universal public domain dedication.
Link: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

